<!-- 货品：支持「传统多列表格 / 高密度卡片」一键切换 + 汇总条 + 独立货品详情页 -->
<view class="page {{wide ? 'page--wide' : ''}}">
  <view class="page__gap">
    <view class="goods-bar">
      <!-- 第一行：搜索 + 表格/卡片视图切换 -->
      <view class="goods-bar__top">
        <view class="goods-search">
          <view class="ico ico--sm ico--search-mu"></view>
          <input
            class="goods-search__in"
            value="{{keyword}}"
            placeholder="搜索商品名 / 进价状态"
            confirm-type="search"
            bindinput="onSearchInput"
          />
          <text wx:if="{{keyword}}" class="goods-search__clr" bindtap="onClearSearch">清空</text>
        </view>

        <view class="view-switch">
          <view
            class="view-switch__btn {{viewMode === 'table' ? 'view-switch__btn--on' : ''}}"
            data-mode="table"
            bindtap="onSwitchView"
          >
            <view class="ico ico--sm {{viewMode === 'table' ? 'ico--table-ink' : 'ico--table-mu'}}"></view>
            <text>表格</text>
          </view>
          <view
            class="view-switch__btn {{viewMode === 'card' ? 'view-switch__btn--on' : ''}}"
            data-mode="card"
            bindtap="onSwitchView"
          >
            <view class="ico ico--sm {{viewMode === 'card' ? 'ico--card-ink' : 'ico--card-mu'}}"></view>
            <text>卡片</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 第二行：筛选胶囊 + 紧凑盘点按钮 -->
      <view class="goods-bar__sub">
        <view class="chips">
          <view class="chip {{filter === 'all' ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="onFilter">
            全部 {{total}}
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{negativeCount > 0}}" class="chip {{filter === 'negative' ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-filter="negative" bindtap="onFilter">
            负库存 {{negativeCount}}
          </view>
          <view class="chip {{filter === 'low' ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-filter="low" bindtap="onFilter">快没了</view>
          <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="chip {{filter === 'nocost' ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-filter="nocost" bindtap="onFilter">缺进价</view>
        </view>

        <button class="goods-count-btn" bindtap="onStartCount">
          <view class="ico ico--sm ico--count-white"></view>
          <text>盘点</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{gapsCount > 0 && !costHidden}}" class="bar" bindtap="onGoGaps">
      <view class="bar__lead">
        <view class="ico ico--sm ico--warn-wn"></view>
        <text>有 {{gapsCount}} 件货缺进价，补上毛利才准</text>
      </view>
      <text class="bar__more">去补</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{errorText}}" class="bar" style="background:var(--dgrb);border-color:#e0b9b0;color:var(--dgr)">
      <text>{{errorText}}</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 库存汇总条 -->
    <view wx:if="{{!loading && rows.length > 0}}" class="card gsum">
      <view class="gsum__item">
        <text class="gsum__k">当前品规</text>
        <text class="gsum__v serif-num">{{shownCount}} 件</text>
      </view>
      <view class="gsum__item">
        <text class="gsum__k">负/低库存</text>
        <text class="gsum__v serif-num {{shownIssueCount > 0 ? 'gsum__v--warn' : ''}}">{{shownIssueCount}} 件</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gsum__item">
        <text class="gsum__k">库存总货值</text>
        <text class="gsum__v serif-num gsum__v--ac">{{totalValueText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:else class="gsum__item">
        <text class="gsum__k">分批管理</text>
        <text class="gsum__v serif-num">{{shownBatchCount}} 件</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 主列表卡 -->
    <view class="card">
      <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">读取中…</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{shown.length === 0}}" class="empty">{{keyword ? '没有搜到匹配的货品' : '这里还没有货'}}</view>

      <!-- 模式 A：传统进销存多列表格 -->
      <block wx:elif="{{viewMode === 'table'}}">
        <scroll-view scroll-x="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false" class="gtbl-wrap">
          <view class="gtbl {{costHidden ? 'gtbl--nocost' : ''}}">
            <!-- 表头 -->
            <view class="gtbl__head">
              <view class="gtbl__th gtbl__sticky gtbl__sticky--head {{sortKey === 'name' ? 'gtbl__th--on' : ''}}" data-key="name" bindtap="onSort">
                <text>货品</text>
                <text wx:if="{{sortKey === 'name'}}" class="gtbl__sort">{{sortDir === 'asc' ? '↑' : '↓'}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="gtbl__th gtbl__th--right {{sortKey === 'stock' ? 'gtbl__th--on' : ''}}" data-key="stock" bindtap="onSort">
                <text>库存</text>
                <text wx:if="{{sortKey === 'stock'}}" class="gtbl__sort">{{sortDir === 'asc' ? '↑' : '↓'}}</text>
              </view>
              <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gtbl__th gtbl__th--right {{sortKey === 'cost' ? 'gtbl__th--on' : ''}}" data-key="cost" bindtap="onSort">
                <text>均价/进价</text>
                <text wx:if="{{sortKey === 'cost'}}" class="gtbl__sort">{{sortDir === 'asc' ? '↑' : '↓'}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="gtbl__th gtbl__th--right {{sortKey === 'sale' ? 'gtbl__th--on' : ''}}" data-key="sale" bindtap="onSort">
                <text>售价</text>
                <text wx:if="{{sortKey === 'sale'}}" class="gtbl__sort">{{sortDir === 'asc' ? '↑' : '↓'}}</text>
              </view>
              <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gtbl__th gtbl__th--right {{sortKey === 'value' ? 'gtbl__th--on' : ''}}" data-key="value" bindtap="onSort">
                <text>库存货值</text>
                <text wx:if="{{sortKey === 'value'}}" class="gtbl__sort">{{sortDir === 'asc' ? '↑' : '↓'}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="gtbl__th gtbl__th--center">
                <text>核算</text>
              </view>
            </view>

            <!-- 表格数据行 -->
            <view
              wx:for="{{shown}}"
              wx:key="id"
              class="gtbl__row"
              data-id="{{item.id}}"
              bindtap="onOpen"
            >
              <view class="gtbl__td gtbl__sticky gtbl__name-cell">
                <text class="gtbl__name">{{item.name}}</text>
                <view class="gtbl__tags" wx:if="{{item.negative || item.low || item.trackBatch}}">
                  <text wx:if="{{item.negative}}" class="gtbl__tag gtbl__tag--neg">负</text>
                  <text wx:elif="{{item.low}}" class="gtbl__tag gtbl__tag--low">低</text>
                  <text wx:if="{{item.trackBatch}}" class="gtbl__tag gtbl__tag--batch">批</text>
                </view>
              </view>

              <view class="gtbl__td gtbl__td--right gtbl__stock {{item.negative ? 'gi__rt--neg' : item.low ? 'gi__rt--low' : ''}}">
                <text class="serif-num">{{item.stock}}</text>
                <text class="gtbl__unit">{{item.unit}}</text>
              </view>

              <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gtbl__td gtbl__td--right gtbl__num {{item.missingCost ? 'gi__sub--warn' : ''}}">
                <text>{{item.costValText}}</text>
              </view>

              <view class="gtbl__td gtbl__td--right gtbl__num">
                <text>{{item.saleValText}}</text>
              </view>

              <view wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gtbl__td gtbl__td--right gtbl__num gtbl__val">
                <text>{{item.valueText}}</text>
              </view>

              <view class="gtbl__td gtbl__td--center">
                <text class="gtbl__mode {{item.trackBatch ? 'gtbl__mode--batch' : ''}}">{{item.batchModeText}}</text>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </scroll-view>
        <view class="gtbl__foot">
          <text class="gtbl__foot-mobile">左右滑动查看更多列 · 点任意货品进详情改价与查流水</text>
          <text class="gtbl__foot-wide">点击表头可排序 · 点任意货品查看详细档案、批次与流水</text>
        </view>
      </block>

      <!-- 模式 B：高密度卡片列表 -->
      <block wx:else>
        <view
          wx:for="{{shown}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="gi"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="onOpen"
        >
          <view class="gi__md">
            <view class="gi__top">
              <text class="gi__name">{{item.name}}</text>
              <text wx:if="{{item.trackBatch}}" class="gi__pill">分批</text>
              <text wx:if="{{item.negative}}" class="gi__pill gi__pill--neg">负库存</text>
              <text wx:elif="{{item.low}}" class="gi__pill">低库存</text>
            </view>
            <view class="gi__meta-row">
              <text wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gi__meta {{item.missingCost ? 'gi__sub--warn' : ''}}">进价 {{item.costValText}}</text>
              <text class="gi__meta">售价 {{item.saleValText}}</text>
              <text wx:if="{{!costHidden}}" class="gi__meta">货值 {{item.valueText}}</text>
              <text class="gi__meta">{{item.batchModeText}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="gi__rt-wrap">
            <view class="gi__rt {{item.negative ? 'gi__rt--neg' : item.low ? 'gi__rt--low' : ''}}">
              <text>{{item.stock}}</text>
              <text class="gi__unit">{{item.unit}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="gi__act-link">详情 ›</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
